docs {
  # Upload a symbol file

  The file should be either a ProGuard file for Android or a zip file containing all the iOS dSYM files.

  **Auth:** Api-Token only (OAuth not supported by this endpoint). Uses `{{DT_API_TOKEN}}`.

  **API token scopes:** DssFileManagement
}
